* SiPAP Rev C - hardware over-pressure cutoff (U3 -> R3/R4 -> U7 LM393 -> Q1 gate)
* LM393: TI PSpice model SLCJ016B (subckt LM2903B). U3 MPXV5010: Vout = Vs*(0.09*P+0.04), NXP DS Transfer Function.
* Pressure ramp 0 -> 3.5 kPa (10 ms) -> 0 (20 ms): P(kPa) = (V(PRESS_RED_RAW)/5 - 0.04)/0.09
* CPAR = 10 pF pin/trace parasitic at COMP_OUT (convergence aid; not a BOM part)
.INCLUDE "C:\Users\ADMIN\EDA Agent\workspace\spice\lm393.lib"
.OPTIONS ITL4=200 RELTOL=0.003 METHOD=GEAR
V5 5V 0 DC 5
V12 VIN12V 0 DC 12
VRAW RAWSRC 0 PWL(0 0.2 10m 1.775 20m 0.2)
RSRC RAWSRC PRESS_RED_RAW 1
C12 PRESS_RED_RAW 0 470p
R3 PRESS_RED_RAW ADC 10k
R4 ADC 0 20k
R10 5V REF 47k
R11 REF 0 10k
XU7 ADC REF 5V 0 COMP LM2903B
CPAR COMP 0 10p
R18 COMP ADC 1MEG
R17 GATE COMP 10k
R13 GATE VIN12V 10k
CQ1 GATE VIN12V 2.06n
R15 COMP TRIP 1MEG
R16 TRIP 0 330k
.TRAN 5u 20m 0 10u
.PLOT TRAN V(PRESS_RED_RAW) V(ADC) V(REF) V(COMP) V(GATE) V(TRIP)
.END
